{
  "id": "ISA.48",
  "number": "48",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 48",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uuindab mugulelwekab Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogas ni anyun, okwek, ee gotab Jakobo, che kimwaitoenok kainetab Israel, che kiobiitune beekab Juda; che oyostosi eng’ kainetab Jehovah, ak omwae Kamuktaindetab Israel, ago ma eng’ iman, anan ko eng’ imanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mwaei kole ki bo nganaset ne tilil, ak kotiiegei Kamuktaindetab Israel: kainennyi ko Jehovah ne bo lugosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiamwaite tuguk che bo tai koboch keny; ee, kimong’une kutinnyu, ak kiabarte: kiayai achokyi, ak kiisulda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kianai ale uuin met, bo karnet kaating’ung’, bo sugunwet togeng’ung’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noto anyun kiamwaun koboch keny; kiasib aborun ama isulda: si memwa ile, kiyaei kanamwennyu, ak king’atei kanamwennyu ne kigiwai, ak kanamwennyu ne kigitany, choto che king’atei chuto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiigas nito; keer chuto tugul-o; ak okwek, ko tos momwaitoi? Kaaborun tuguk che leelach koboch nguno, agot tuguk che ung’otin, che tom inai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitau keyaei nguno, ma boch keny; ak kitom igas agoi betuni; si memwa ile, Keero, kiangen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, kitom igas, ee kitom inai; ee kitom koyatak iting’ung’: amu kiangen ale iyae kaberberisiet ne o, ak kigiguurenen bistoindet koboch imi mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agoitoi neregekyuk amu kainennyu, ak amuitoi agobo inye amu kalosunennyu, si magesun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keero, kaatililin eng’ mat, ago ma ko u feda; kaalewenin eng’ mat ne o ne bo nyalilda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayae amu kainennyu, amu kainennyu; amu kimuruonindoi ano kainennyu? Amagochini age torornatennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oepcha it, ee Jakobo, ak Israel nenyu, ne kiaguur: a inendet; a ne bo tai, ak ko a ne bo let kogeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, kilum eunnyu lumeiywotab ng’ony, ak kiito eunnyu ne bo tai kipsengwetisiek: ye aguur ichek, kotononso kibagenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soru Jehovah Israel eng’ Kirus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyumge, okwek tugul, si ogas; ng’o eng’ ichek ne kigomwaita tuguchuto? Kigocham Jehovah inendet: yaei eng’ Babulon kit ne chamei, ak kotebe eunnyi Kaldeik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ane, ee anendet ne kiamwae; ee kiaguur inendet: kiamutu, ak borei inendet eng’ orennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orikya, ogas ni; tom amwa kiy eng’ ung’ot koboch keny; kiami koboch agoi; kagoyokta anyun Kiptaiyat Jehovah, ak Tamirmiriennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaei ko u ni Jehovah, katiangindeng’ung’, Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel: A Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, ne inetin ibor, ne indoun eng’ oret ne kanyol ibun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kita mie nda kigegas ng’atutikyuk! Kita igeitu kalyeng’ung’ ainet, ak koigei imandang’ung’ beekab nyanjet che mildogei: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kita tenitu ng’aniek iyoteng’ung’, ak koigei lagoguk che kiisiche, chang’indab ng’aniek: kima kota kiistoi kainennyi anan keng’em eng’ tainnyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omande eng’ Babulon, omwee Kaldeik; obarte eng’ cheetab tiendo, omwaite nito, omwa kogasak agoi ole boch ng’ony: omwa ole, Kigotiach Jehovah Jakobo otwogindennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma am melelda ichek ye kigimuti kobun ong’atosiek: kiigochi beek korootune ruandet konaga ichek: kibet ruandet kogeny, ak kitumgei beek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaei Jehovah kole, Mami kalyet eng’ kiptengeginik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
